-p0180","role":"交结豪杰者，后叛逆","evidence":["santizhu059-q-dfdc07cd5f4524debe53"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu059-q-dfdc07cd5f4524debe53"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu059-q-dfdc07cd5f4524debe53","source_order":[59,26,0],"order":10427},{"id":"santizhu059-e-sr-binyou-mu","title":"孙登使胡综作《宾友目》、羊衜私驳","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu059-a-6ff8d3b68107a2c026da","label":"裴注·江表传","text":"《江表传》称登使侍中胡综作《宾友目》品评恪谭景慎；衜私驳综评四友各有指趣，卒以此言见咎不为恪等所亲","evidence":["santizhu059-q-706ca9485cff86e2ec84"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhouyu-p0025","role":"使胡综作宾友目","evidence":["santizhu059-q-706ca9485cff86e2ec84"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0091","role":"作宾友目","evidence":["santizhu059-q-706ca9485cff86e2ec84"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0097","role":"私驳胡综之评","evidence":["santizhu059-q-706ca9485cff86e2ec84"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu059-q-706ca9485cff86e2ec84"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu059-q-706ca9485cff86e2ec84","source_order":[59,26,0],"order":10429},{"id":"santizhu059-e-o055a","title":"羊衜上疏请求恢复二宫礼命","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu059-a-f83067970b6cfe394c7c","label":"正文","text":"羊衜上疏请求恢复二宫礼命","evidence":["santizhu059-q-74fce3a94ccf6c297d66"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0097","role":"上疏请求恢复二宫礼命","evidence":["santizhu059-q-74fce3a94ccf6c297d66"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"受奏者","evidence":["santizhu059-q-74fce3a94ccf6c297d66"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu059-q-74fce3a94ccf6c297d66"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu059-q-74fce3a94ccf6c297d66","source_order":[59,55,0],"order":10482},{"id":"hequan-e-p105","title":"羊衜书滕胤褒牧威恩部伍","accounts":[{"id":"hequan-a-1f48b0b6acfdd1cd788c","label":"裴注·《会稽典录》","text":"羊衜书滕胤褒牧威恩部伍","evidence":["hequan-q-58d838412166414edab0"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0097","role":"始兴太守、与太常滕胤书称钟离子幹定见其在南海威恩部伍智勇分明、加操行清纯有古人之风","evidence":["hequan-q-58d838412166414edab0"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0005","role":"受书者","evidence":["hequan-q-58d838412166414edab0"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0023","role":"被褒者","evidence":["hequan-q-58d838412166414edab0"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["hequan-q-58d838412166414edab0"]},"ordering_evidence":"hequan-q-58d838412166414edab0","source_order":[60,425,96],"order":10689}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0097","name":"羊衜","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o126","jfj-q0097","jfj-q0096","santizhu-q-f012df6111efbabf2629","santizhu-q-fd56f067f59cfe391492","santizhu059-q-74fce3a94ccf6c297d66","santizhu059-q-8d2f4ed4ed63ce5a50c1","hequan-q-58d838412166414edab0","gongsuntao-q-d84eba194b5130038c25","zhanggu-q-d7c6bfee867816b7caf2"],"facts":[{"id":"santizhu059-f-sr-080","text":"后四人（恪谭景慎）皆败，吴人谓衜之言有征；衜位至桂阳太守，卒","evidence":["santizhu059-q-8d2f4ed4ed63ce5a50c1"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-o126-wuzhu-p0097","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o126"]},{"id":"jfj-m-o023-wuzhu-p0097","kind":"mention","text":"本段记载：费祎应对孙权诸葛恪羊衜论难","evidence":["jfj-q0096"]},{"id":"zhanggu-m-0a7b861d26e71b2d29e1","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及羊衜","evidence":["zhanggu-q-d7c6bfee867816b7caf2"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"gongsuntao-q-d84eba194b5130038c25","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-6d7592f0b72957b8a85c","layer":"pei","quote":"吴人欲戮其使，羊衜曰：‘不可！是肆匹夫之怒而捐霸王之计也。不如因而厚之，遣奇兵潜往以要其成。若魏伐渊不克，而我军远赴，是恩结遐夷，义盖万里；若兵连不解，首尾离隔，则我虏其傍郡，驱略而归，亦足以致天之罚，报雪曩事矣","attribution":"裴注·汉晋春秋","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":229,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9c98811cc1c68601b539","start":44,"end":150,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-58d838412166414edab0","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-1017a8c1da2e3cef2cf5","layer":"pei","quote":"始兴太守羊衜，与太常滕胤书曰：‘钟离子幹，吾昔知之不熟；定见其在南海，威恩部伍，智勇分明；加操行清纯，有古人之风","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":424,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-43dc051269e0fb8c25a0","start":96,"end":152,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o050","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-6dc749ac781a81d5a82f","layer":"original","quote":"帝疾困，遂立为皇后。齐王即位，尊后为皇太后，称“永宁宫”。追封谥太后父满，为西都定侯，以立子建绍其爵。封太后母杜，为郃阳君。芝迁散骑常侍、长水校尉；﹝一﹞立，宣德将军〖2〗；皆封列侯。建兄德，出养甄氏。德及建，俱为镇护将军〖3〗，皆封列侯，并掌宿卫。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":236,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":125,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0096","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-3498a5eae3baf1069208","layer":"original","quote":"亮以初从南归，以祎为昭信校尉使吴〖9〗。孙权性既滑稽〖10〗，嘲啁无方〖11〗；诸葛恪、羊衜等才博果辩〖12〗，论难锋至〖13〗；祎辞顺义笃，据理以答，终不能屈。﹝二﹞权甚器之，谓祎曰：“君天下淑德，必当股肱蜀朝〖14〗，恐不能数来也〖15〗。”﹝三﹞还，迁为侍中。亮北住汉中，请祎为参军。以奉使称旨〖16〗，频繁至吴。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":109,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":160,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0097","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-3498a5eae3baf1069208","layer":"original","quote":"孙权性既滑稽〖10〗，嘲啁无方〖11〗；诸葛恪、羊衜等才博果辩〖12〗，论难锋至〖13〗；祎辞顺义笃，据理以答，终不能屈。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":109,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-e59395a0e3cfa7e31144","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-e59395a0e3cfa7e31144","layer":"modern","quote":"〖4〗三年：景初三年（公元 239）。丁亥：旧历初一日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":496,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-271e1436daf6e49feb83","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o068","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-15faf626ce48eb2f68b4","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月，丁亥〖4〗，太尉宣王还至河内；帝驿马召到〖5〗，引入卧内，执其手谓曰：“吾疾甚！以后事属君。君其与爽辅少子〖6〗。吾得见君，无所恨！”宣王顿首流涕〖7〗。﹝一﹞即日，帝崩于嘉福殿。﹝二﹞时年三十六〖8〗。﹝三﹞癸丑〖9〗，葬高平陵〖10〗。﹝四﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":491,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-f012df6111efbabf2629","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-ee93699dac12389e55ea","layer":"pei","quote":"闻羊衜有人物之鉴，往干之。衜曰：‘多事之世，尚书剧曹郎才也","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b67c177f97871b035fb2","start":35,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-fd56f067f59cfe391492","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-ee93699dac12389e55ea","layer":"pei","quote":"衜曰：‘非李衡无能困之者！’遂共荐为郎","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b67c177f97871b035fb2","start":88,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-706ca9485cff86e2ec84","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-0b7d8c39eaea0ad6ff01","layer":"pei","quote":"《江表传》曰：“登使侍中胡综作《宾友目》曰：‘英才卓越，超逾伦匹，则诸葛恪；精识时机，达幽究微，则顾谭；凝辨宏达，言能释结，则谢景；究学甄微，游夏同科，则范慎。’衜乃私驳综曰：‘元逊才而疏，子嘿精而狠，叔发辨而浮，孝敬深而狭。’所言皆有指趣。而衜卒以此言见咎，不为恪等所亲。","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":25,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-907884c580254ae9cf88","start":237,"end":374,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-74fce3a94ccf6c297d66","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-98aecb90f36e936bf9a6","layer":"original","quote":"督军使者羊衜上疏曰〖3〗：“臣闻古之有天下者，皆先显别嫡庶，封建子弟；所以尊重祖宗，为国藩表也。二宫拜授〖4〗，海内称宜。斯乃大吴兴隆之基。顷闻二宫，并绝宾客；远近悚然，大小失望。窃从下风〖5〗，听采众论；咸谓：‘二宫，智达英茂；自正名建号，于今三年；德行内著，美称外昭；西北二隅〖6〗，久所服闻。’谓陛下‘当副顺遐迩所以归德〖7〗，勤命二宫宾延四远〖8〗；使异国闻声，思为臣妾〖9〗。’今既未垂意于此，而发明诏：省夺备卫，抑绝宾客；使四方礼敬，不复得通。虽实陛下敦尚古义，欲令二宫专志于学，不复顾虑观听小宜〖10〗，期于温故博物而已；然非臣下倾企喁喁之至愿也！或谓‘二宫不遵典式’，此臣所以寝息不宁。就如所嫌，犹宜补察，密加斟酌；不使远近得容异言〖11〗。臣惧积疑成谤，久将宣流；而西北二隅，去国不远：异同之语，易以闻达。闻达之日，声论当兴；将谓二宫有不顺之愆〖12〗。不审陛下何以解之？若无以解异国，则亦无以释境内。境内守疑，异国兴谤；非所以育巍巍〖13〗，镇社稷也。愿陛下早发优诏〖14〗，使二宫周旋礼命如初；则天清地晏，万国幸甚矣","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":226,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":469,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-8d2f4ed4ed63ce5a50c1","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-0efb52f3ae893d9ec4db","layer":"pei","quote":"后四人皆败，吴人谓衜之言有征。位至桂阳太守，卒。”","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":26,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-907884c580254ae9cf88","start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-dfdc07cd5f4524debe53","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-0b7d8c39eaea0ad6ff01","layer":"pei","quote":"《吴书》曰：“衜初为中庶子，年二十。时廷尉监隐蕃，交结豪杰。自卫将军全琮等，皆倾心敬待；惟衜及宣诏郎豫章杨迪，拒绝不与通：时人咸怪之。而蕃后叛逆，众乃服之。”","attribution":"裴注·吴书（引《吴书》）","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":25,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-907884c580254ae9cf88","start":158,"end":237,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o002","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-69d95c2d10b2c4a40b0c","layer":"original","quote":"青龙三年，立为齐王。景初三年正月，丁亥朔，帝病甚，乃立为皇太子。是日，即皇帝位。大赦。尊皇后曰皇太后〖2〗。大将军曹爽、太尉司马宣王辅政。诏曰：“朕以眇身〖3〗，继承鸿业。茕茕在疚〖4〗，靡所控告〖5〗。大将军、太尉奉受末命〖6〗，夹辅朕躬；司徒、司空，冢宰元辅总率百僚〖7〗，以宁社稷；其与群卿大夫勉勖乃心〖8〗，称朕意焉。”诸所兴作宫室之役，皆以遗诏罢之；官奴婢六十以上，免为良人〖9〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":196,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o126a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-ab932a5023f68052057f","layer":"original","quote":"二年春三月〖1〗，﹝一﹞遣使者羊衜、郑胄、将军孙怡，之辽东，击魏守将张持、高虑等，虏得男女。﹝二﹞零陵言甘露降。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o126","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-ab932a5023f68052057f","layer":"original","quote":"二年春三月〖1〗，﹝一﹞遣使者羊衜、郑胄、将军孙怡，之辽东，击魏守将张持、高虑等，虏得男女。﹝二﹞零陵言甘露降。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-d7c6bfee867816b7caf2","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-e7c668f34b2cb03e8c27","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞陆机为谭传曰：“宣太子正位东宫，天子方隆训导之义；妙简俊彦，讲学左右。时四方之杰毕集，太傅诸葛恪等，雄奇盖众；而谭以清识绝伦，独见推重。自太尉范慎、谢景、（羊徽）〔羊衟〕之徒，皆以秀称；其名而悉在谭下。”","attribution":"裴注·陆机《顾谭传》","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6e97af01b0f6928da4e6","start":0,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
